{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/fd2e20c78eb608f8fb4f62c3299284e9.avif?t=1756512187\" width=774 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fling, fail, and laugh your way to the top in <i>Fling &quot;Friends&quot;</i>\u00a0- a 3D co-op physics platformer where one bad Fling drags everyone down!</strong> You and up to Eight friends are tied together by a single Magic rope, climbing a massive Evil Tower full of traps, puzzles, and pure rope-fueled chaos. Every fling can save the team\u2026 or yeet everyone into disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/02eac598b9764ec7bed18a5a7f8db3fd.avif?t=1756512187\" data-has-big width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forget fancy combos.</strong> One press Fling <strong>everyone</strong> toward you, whether they\u2019re ready or not. Sometimes it\u2019s teamwork, sometimes it\u2019s sabotage - either way, it\u2019s hilarious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/a18ac4ded4f50483ce31ca225e5bedd5.avif?t=1756512187\" data-has-big width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each player\u2019s color determines what they can touch.</strong> Work together to unlock paths, activate mechanisms, and toss your friends across impossible gaps. No one climbs alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/dc93ba0e22170c4100f2b06b6eaf3ae6.avif?t=1756512187\" data-has-big width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore towering megastructures and surreal ruins wrapped in a colorful Arabian-inspired art style. From crumbling machine rooms to glowing signal towers.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986580?t=1756512187","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986580?t=1756512187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/9fea9f35491ffc2f9833c4a6e49a72b732d17121/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756512187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/9fea9f35491ffc2f9833c4a6e49a72b732d17121/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756512187","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/fd2e20c78eb608f8fb4f62c3299284e9.avif?t=1756512187\" width=774 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fling, fail, and laugh your way to the top in <i>Fling &quot;Friends&quot;</i>\u00a0- a 3D co-op physics platformer where one bad Fling drags everyone down!</strong> You and up to Eight friends are tied together by a single Magic rope, climbing a massive Evil Tower full of traps, puzzles, and pure rope-fueled chaos. Every fling can save the team\u2026 or yeet everyone into disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shar